keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - ppo
  - cryptocurrency
  - trading
  - portfolio allocation
  - stable-baselines3
  - gymnasium
abstract: >-
  A PPO seed-ensemble that allocates a portfolio across BTC, ETH and SOL from
  technical, on-chain and macro features, with a Gymnasium trading
  environment, multi-objective reward, walk-forward backtesting against
  rule-based baselines, a pre-registered evaluation protocol with burned
  held-out test windows, and a paper-trading loop guarded by a volatility
  circuit breaker, kill switch and hard risk limits.
